@startmindmap
* Sentry capture policy boundary
** API exception / transaction
*** gebaut: FastAPIIntegration
*** gebaut: StarletteIntegration
** Init policy
*** gebaut: main.py::_sentry_init_options
*** offen: include_local_variables explicit false
*** offen: max_request_body_size explicit never
** Event construction
*** gebaut: stack and exception metadata
*** implicit default: frame locals
*** implicit default: request body
** Defense filter
*** gebaut: main.py::_before_send_filter
*** redacts known sensitive keys and request fields
** Transport
*** gebaut: Sentry SDK envelope transport
** Regression tests
*** partial: hook wiring and known-secret redaction
*** offen: arbitrary local/body exclusion
@endmindmap

@startuml
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
component "FastAPI / Starlette\nexception or transaction" as WEB
component "Sentry init policy\nmain.py::_sentry_init_options" as POLICY
component "SDK event construction\nstack + request context" as SDK
component "Defense filter\nmain.py::_before_send_filter" as FILTER
component "Sentry transport" as TRANSPORT
component "Policy tests\ntest_sentry_secret_scrubbing.py" as TESTS

WEB --> SDK : H1 exception / transaction
POLICY --> SDK : H2 integrations + capture policy
SDK --> SDK : H3 frame locals (implicit default)
SDK --> SDK : H4 request body (implicit default)
SDK --> FILTER : H5 constructed event
FILTER --> TRANSPORT : H6 filtered envelope
TESTS ..> POLICY : pin options
TESTS ..> TRANSPORT : inspect offline envelope
@enduml
